/a><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul></div><!--]--><div class=\"absolute top-full left-0 isolate z-50 flex justify-center\"><!----></div><!--]--></nav></div></nav><!--]--><div class=\"pt-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-100 via-orange-100 to-gray-100\"><div class=\"flex justify-center items-center\"><div class=\"grid gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><div class=\"w-3/4 mb-8 mt-12 mx-auto\"><h1 class=\"heading mb-5 px-2 text-center text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.12rem] text-primary-text md:px-0 md:text-6xl\"> Write and collaborate on <span class=\"fraunces italic\">CQL</span></h1><p class=\"mt-8 text-xl font-light text-gray-700 text-center\"> Clinical logic coders use Spark every day for its powerful syntax highlighting, instant error detection, and collaboration features for teams to write CQL. </p><div class=\"mt-8 flex justify-center items-center gap-2\"><a href=\"/signup\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#39;size-&#39;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 rounded-md px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 w-64\" data-slot=\"button\">Sign Up Now for Free</a><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#39;size-&#39;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-10 rounded-md px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 w-64\" data-slot=\"button\">Request a Demo</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 w-11/12 mx-auto\"><div class=\"p-5\"><div aria-busy=\"false\" aria-label=\"Vimeo Player - Placeholder\" aria-live=\"polite\" role=\"application\" style=\"max-width:100%;width:auto;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;position:relative;background-color:black;\" onmousedown=\"this.dataset.script_mousedown = true\" class=\"group\"><div class=\"vimeo-player\" style=\"display:none;\"></div><!--[--><img src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/2011813986-624b0f720654b1c36e9b26b6ac717e10f237896939423ccb9823ab670ad955bf-d_295x166?region=us\" alt loading=\"lazy\" style=\"cursor:pointer;width:100%;object-fit:contain;height:100%;\"><!--]--><!----><!--[--><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-orange-500 group-hover:bg-orange-700 transition rounded px-6 py-2\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"w-10 h-10 text-white\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 12C19 12.3557 18.8111 12.6846 18.5039 12.8638L6.50387 19.8638C6.19458 20.0442 5.81243 20.0455 5.50194 19.8671C5.19145 19.6888 5 19.3581 5 19L5 5C5 4.64193 5.19145 4.3112 5.50194 4.13286C5.81243 3.95452 6.19458 3.9558 6.50387 4.13622L18.5039 11.1362C18.8111 11.3154 19 11.6443 19 12Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></div><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class=\"my-8\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-center text-gray-500 mb-5\"> As featured in </h2><div class=\"flex justify-center items-center space-x-4 w-full\"><img class=\"h-14 grayscale-75 opacity-75\" src=\"/openhie.avif\"><img alt=\"seen on AEHIN\" class=\"h-20 grayscale-75 opacity-75\" src=\"/3326252f9181a1f5b420f1a9eb427116.avif\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden bg-white py-24 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 sm:gap-y-20 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"lg:pr-8 lg:pt-4\"><div class=\"lg:max-w-lg\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-green-600\"> Deploy Clinical Logic Faster </h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl\"> A better workflow from DAK to executable clinical logic </p><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600\"> Code clinical logic in CQL faster with Spark editor, convert logic in Digital Adaptation Kits (DAK) to executable CQL and deploy your first FHIR library within minutes. </p><dl class=\"mt-10 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600 lg:max-w-none\"><div class=\"relative pl-9\"><dt class=\"inline font-semibold text-gray-900\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" style=\"\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"absolute left-1 top-1 h-4.5 w-4.5 text-amber-600\"></svg> Autocomplete based on data dictionary </dt><dd class=\"inline\"> Rapidly code CQL with autocomplete based on your data dictionary, upload or connect a terminology server and start coding in seconds. </dd></div><div class=\"relative pl-9\"><dt class=\"inline font-semibold text-gray-900\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" style=\"\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"absolute left-1 top-1 h-6 w-6 text-orange-500\"></svg> Export as FHIR library </dt><dd class=\"inline\"> Export your CQL as a FHIR library with an API endpoint, making your clinical logic readily available for a CQL engine or a FHIR server. </dd></div><div class=\"relative pl-9\"><dt class=\"inline font-semibold text-gray-900\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" style=\"\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"absolute left-1 top-1 h-5 w-5 text-teal-600\"></svg> Real-time error checking. </dt><dd class=\"inline\"> Spark editor provides real-time syntax highlighting and error checking as you write your CQL logic. No need to capture CQL errors when deploying. </dd></div></dl></div></div><div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden bg-white py-24 sm:pb-32 sm:pt-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl gap-x-8 gap-y-16 sm:gap-y-20 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none\"><div class=\"lg:pr-8 lg:pt-4 col-span-1 order-last\"><div class=\"lg:max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" style=\"\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" class=\"h-12 w-12 text-indigo-600\"></svg><p class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl\"> Visualize Your Clinical Logic </p></div><dl class=\"mt-10 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600 lg:max-w-none\"><div class=\"relative pl-9\"><dt class=\"inline font-semibold text-gray-900\"> Visualize your logic </dt><dd class=\"inline\"> Visualize CQL logic whether it&#39;s a basic logic or advanced, as a visual graph. Making it easier to read and understand even without understanding CQL language. Ideal for clinicians and guideline creators. </dd></div></dl></div></div><div class=\"col-span-3 order-first h-screen w-full hidden lg:block\"><div></div></div></div></div></div><footer class=\"bg-white border-t border-gray-w200 dark:bg-gray-900\"><div class=\"y-12 w-5/6 mt-4 mx-auto\"><div class=\"px-6 py-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center font-mono font-light\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"